    "closure": "exclusion of the zero heavy row on the complete separated double-root locus",
    "statement": "On the squarefree supported-disjoint separated double-root locus, G(t,x_*) is nonzero for every center-overlap degree j. If it vanished, X-x_* would divide G. At a correction root which is not off-line supported, including a center root, this forces resultant order at least three against the exact order two from E_4=S_B^2. At an off-line supported root, actual support violates first-jet transversality and padding violates gcd(g_*,S_B)=1. Hence every overlap form T_j and every passing barycentric remainder is nonzero.",
